81
00:08:24,224 --> 00:08:39,583
Criminals would try to do phishing attacks to steal your money out of your bank accounts or would try to con you into giving out your credentials, thus compromising your email accounts or your social media accounts and try to gain access to your identity.

82
00:08:39,885 --> 00:08:48,864
Cybercrimes are generally carried out against computers or devices directly to damage or disable them, spread malware, steal secret information, etc.

83
00:08:49,184 --> 00:08:52,384
So this talks about the motivation part of cybercrimes.

84
00:08:52,544 --> 00:08:57,744
What would be the motivational aspect for a person to conduct such an activity?

85
00:08:57,984 --> 00:08:58,304
Right?

86
