The perpetrators, those those used WannaCry probably gained a lot in the ransom that they demanded for that data to be decrypted, but it also cost the world a lot of money in profits that were lost.

88
00:09:16,144 --> 00:09:18,304
So let's talk about types of cybercrime.

89
00:09:18,464 --> 00:09:24,704
The first type is a computer assisted crime where the computers are used as tools to assist a particular crime.

90
00:09:24,878 --> 00:09:33,744
For example, frauds or online bank hijacking where hackers hack into a bank and digitally steal money from a bank.

91
00:09:33,904 --> 00:09:41,824
Now this could have happened without the help of computers as well, but here computer assisted the crime and hence it would fall under the computer assisted crime section.

92
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:45,104
The second part is where the computer itself was a target of a crime.

93
00:09:45,184 --> 00:09:55,664
For example, a denial of service attack or viruses which rendered the computer useless or sniffing of data packets on the network, thus compromising passwords and other confidential information.

94
00:09:55,904 --> 00:09:59,140
The third is a computer which is incidental to the crime.

95
00:09:59,344 --> 00:10:09,904
So here the computer was used as a temporary measure to store some data such as child pornography or some other some other data which made the computer incidental to the crime.

