Demanding ransom, hackers can encrypt your data and then demand a ransom from you in lieu of decrypting the data again.

119
00:13:15,086 --> 00:13:25,536
Damaging reputation of a target, impersonating a user on the social media platforms, making false statements, thus damaging the reputation of that person, and propagating religious or political beliefs.

