6276
10:14:03,790 --> 10:14:11,616
S5 is a circular shift by 5 bits and Wt is a 32-bit string derived from the existing subblock.

6277
10:14:11,822 --> 10:14:15,172
This can be calculated depending on the iteration at hand.

6278
10:14:16,238 --> 10:14:23,684
Kt signifies a single element of the 80 character element array which changes depending on the particular round at hand.

6279
10:14:24,334 --> 10:14:32,132
