10:42:28,430 --> 10:42:30,916
There are essentially five phases in ethical hacking.

6532
10:42:31,886 --> 10:42:35,044
The reconnaissance phase is the first phase of the penetration test.

6533
10:42:35,918 --> 10:42:39,236
Here, the security researcher collects information about the target.

6534
10:42:39,502 --> 10:42:42,276
It can be done actively or passively or both.

6535
10:42:42,990 --> 10:42:49,156
