Okay, the private instance is pingable.

8577
14:50:50,670 --> 14:50:52,580
We'll now try to SSH to it.

8578
14:50:57,166 --> 14:51:02,820
As you can see, we are in the private instance, so the Bastion host is also working fine.

8579
14:51:03,598 --> 14:51:07,268
And now let's try to ping something on the internet from the private instance.

8580
14:51:09,838 --> 14:51:13,152
As you can see, the private network is connecting to the internet.

8581
