And then to Nat Gateways.

8586
14:51:40,270 --> 14:51:41,796
We'll create a NAT gateway.

8587
14:51:48,110 --> 14:51:50,596
And we are going to create it in public subnet.

8588
14:51:55,246 --> 14:51:57,092
It wants an elastic IP.

8589
