there are other systems that I I was talking to a threat hunter and also to an analyst who said, hey, the Excel spreadsheet is is the killer app because it allows me to create tables to identify to the CEO what the problems are.

11177
19:05:54,608 --> 19:05:58,848
But there's Virus Total, Squirrel Data, Endgame, NTOP uh, very useful tools.

11178
