12455
21:24:22,510 --> 21:24:29,200
We drew inspiration from industry best practices and case studies, learning how leaders strengthen their defenses.

12456
21:24:29,486 --> 21:24:36,932
And finally, we explored emerging technologies, from AI to blockchain, that are shaping the future of financial security.

12457
21:24:37,200 --> 21:24:44,640
At its core, cybersecurity and finance is not just about technology, but about trust, resilience, and readiness.

12458
21:24:44,910 --> 21:24:54,800
As financial systems evolve, so too must our security mindset, because protecting data is ultimately about protecting people, businesses, and economies.

