23:19:27,296 --> 23:19:29,828
It allows us input and output functions.

13471
23:19:32,558 --> 23:19:42,656
for example, the basic example you open up Microsoft Office products like Microsoft Word or Excel and you get a GUI on the screen which you can interact with.

13472
23:19:42,736 --> 23:19:54,436
