The browser will send a copy of the SSL certificate.

14202
24:45:15,406 --> 24:45:18,464
The browser verifies if the SSL certificate is trustworthy.

14203
24:45:18,670 --> 24:45:24,132
If trustworthy, the browser will send a message to the server requesting to establish an encrypted connection.

14204
24:45:24,366 --> 24:45:28,864
The web server acknowledges and starts to build an SSL encrypted connection.

14205
24:45:29,166 --> 24:45:33,252
The encrypted SSL communication begins between the browser and the web server.

